      "content": "I am so sorry you are feeling this intense sense of guilt and self-blame; please remember that you are not responsible for the self-worth of your family. A moment of unhappiness or a difficult life path is unlikely to \"poison\" a lifetime of love and sacrifice you all share. You deserve to be okay, and I encourage you to talk to a trusted counselor to help you process these weighty feelings so they don't control your life.",
