      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The thought that your life is a permanent \"error\" you can erase by ending it is a dangerous feeling that you do not have the right to act on. No death can ever \"undo\" your existence or \"cleanse\" a legacy that was built on the love and struggle of your living family. I urge you to speak to a crisis counselor immediately who can help you find the hope you are starving for and see your life with the hope you deserve.",
