    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so selfish to keep going when i know i'm making them weaker. how can you say it doesn't matter? if a person is carrying a heavy weight that's dragging everyone else down into the mud, isn't the most honorable thing they can do to just... let go? to step aside so the rest of the line can rise above the mess i've made? it feels like an act of service, honestly. more like a sacrifice for their sake than anything else.",
